**POST /api/v1/memos**

The `CreateMemo` RPC declares its REST mapping at `proto/api/v1/memo_service.proto:21-25`:

```
rpc CreateMemo(CreateMemoRequest) returns (Memo) {
  option (google.api.http) = {
    post: "/api/v1/memos"
    body: "memo"
  };
```

So it maps to `POST /api/v1/memos`, with the request's `memo` field as the request body.
